    "html": "<p>The distance between two isolated particles is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\"></span> m. The mass of one particle is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"9M\"></span> and the mass of the other particle is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25M\"></span>. Point R is at a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span> from the particle with mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"9M\"></span>. The resultant gravitational force on a particle of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2M\"></span> placed at point R is zero.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.0\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.5\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.5\"></span> m</li>\n</ol>"
